{
  "name": "mackorn-cone-crusher",
  "version": "0.2.2",
  "description": "MACKORN 美矿液压圆锥破（NH/NS）与破碎筛分生产线选型：22 个工具覆盖客户需求表录入、机型/腔型/CSS 选型、整线配置、粒度曲线仿真（Whiten 1972）、实测数据标定、能耗成本估算、衬板磨损设计、经销商评估与 14 章方案书生成。DeepSeek Harness 插件 + MCP 服务器（stdio 与远程 HTTP 双通道），零依赖。",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "private": false,
  "main": "plugin/index.mjs",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./plugin/index.mjs",
    "./mcp": "./plugin/mcp-server.mjs",
    "./tools": "./plugin/lib/engine.mjs"
  },
  "bin": {
    "mackorn-cone-crusher": "plugin/mcp-server.mjs",
    "mackorn-mcp": "plugin/mcp-server.mjs"
  },
